    ["“这块晶石是一口金色泉水的心脏。”\n从村中的老者手中得到这枚护符时，他还不是一位士兵。但随着战况的逐步胶着，他也同无数原本生活在弗萨克小村的年轻人一样，被征召进了队伍，前往了不知何处的战场。\n他不知道这场战争从何而起，也不知这场战斗为何结束。在生命最后的时光，他只看到了夜色铺满了天际，而衰朽的辉光自高空落下。\n直到胜利者拨开了他已经冰冷的衣襟，护符上的结晶映照着那坠落的黄昏，仍旧金黄。"] = "\"This crystal is the heart of a golden spring.\" \nWhen he received this amulet from the village elder, he was not yet a soldier. But as the war situation gradually reached a stalemate, he, like countless young people who originally lived in the small Feynapotter village, was conscripted into the ranks and headed to a battlefield somewhere unknown. \nHe did not know where this war started, nor did he know why this battle ended. In the final moments of his life, he only saw the night covering the horizon, and the decaying radiance falling from the high sky. \nUntil the victor pushed aside his already cold collar, the crystal on the amulet reflected the falling dusk, still golden.",
